          <span>{t("faq.q2", lang, "Is my data stored or sent anywhere?")}</span>
          <svg
            class="h-4 w-4 shrink-0 text-muted transition-transform duration-200 group-open:rotate-180"
            viewBox="0 0 24 24"
            fill="none"
            stroke="currentColor"
            stroke-width="2"
            stroke-linecap="round"
            stroke-linejoin="round"
            aria-hidden="true"
            ><polyline points="6 9 12 15 18 9"></polyline></svg
          >
        </summary>
        <div
          class="border-t border-card-border px-5 pt-4 pb-5 text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted dark:text-muted"
        >
          {t("faq.a2", lang, "No. Everything runs 100% in your browser. No accounts, no cookies, no data collection. Your results stay on your device.")}
        </div>
      </details>

      <!-- FAQ 3 -->
      <details
        class="group overflow-hidden rounded-xl border border-card-border bg-card"
      >
        <summary
          class="flex cursor-pointer list-none items-center justify-between gap-4 p-5 text-sm font-bold text-foreground hover:bg-subtle [&::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden"
        >
          <span>{t("faq.q3", lang, "How accurate are the measurements?")}</span>
          <svg
            class="h-4 w-4 shrink-0 text-muted transition-transform duration-200 group-open:rotate-180"
            viewBox="0 0 24 24"
            fill="none"
            stroke="currentColor"
            stroke-width="2"
            stroke-linecap="round"
            stroke-linejoin="round"
            aria-hidden="true"
            ><polyline points="6 9 12 15 18 9"></polyline></svg
          >
        </summary>
        <div
          class="border-t border-card-border px-5 pt-4 pb-5 text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted dark:text-muted"
        >
          {t("faq.a3", lang, "We use requestAnimationFrame timing with sub-millisecond precision. Our calibration system accounts for monitor refresh rate and browser input latency to give you the most accurate physical reaction measurements possible.")}
        </div>
      </details>

      <!-- FAQ 4 -->
      <details
        class="group overflow-hidden rounded-xl border border-card-border bg-card"
      >
        <summary
          class="flex cursor-pointer list-none items-center justify-between gap-4 p-5 text-sm font-bold text-foreground hover:bg-subtle [&::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden"
        >
          <span>{t("faq.q4", lang, "What is the Brain Challenge (Gauntlet)?")}</span>
          <svg
            class="h-4 w-4 shrink-0 text-muted transition-transform duration-200 group-open:rotate-180"
            viewBox="0 0 24 24"
            fill="none"
            stroke="currentColor"
            stroke-width="2"
            stroke-linecap="round"
            stroke-linejoin="round"
            aria-hidden="true"
            ><polyline points="6 9 12 15 18 9"></polyline></svg
          >
        </summary>
        <div
          class="border-t border-card-border px-5 pt-4 pb-5 text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted dark:text-muted"
        >
          {t("faq.a4", lang, "The Gauntlet is our flagship 5-stage cognitive assessment covering reaction, memory, focus, reasoning, and precision. You receive a unified CAI score and cognitive archetype, plus a hexagonal radar profile showing your strengths across all dimensions.")}
        </div>
      </details>

      <!-- FAQ 5 -->
      <details
        class="group overflow-hidden rounded-xl border border-card-border bg-card"
      >
        <summary
          class="flex cursor-pointer list-none items-center justify-between gap-4 p-5 text-sm font-bold text-foreground hover:bg-subtle [&::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden"
        >
          <span>{t("faq.q5", lang, "Can I improve my scores over time?")}</span>
          <svg
            class="h-4 w-4 shrink-0 text-muted transition-transform duration-200 group-open:rotate-180"
            viewBox="0 0 24 24"
            fill="none"
            stroke="currentColor"
            stroke-width="2"
            stroke-linecap="round"
            stroke-linejoin="round"
            aria-hidden="true"
            ><polyline points="6 9 12 15 18 9"></polyline></svg
          >
        </summary>
        <div
          class="border-t border-card-border px-5 pt-4 pb-5 text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted dark:text-muted"
        >
          {t("faq.a5", lang, "Yes. Each assessment includes evidence-based training guidance. Our Learning Center has 20+ in-depth guides covering the neuroscience behind every cognitive domain, with practical protocols for measurable improvement.")}
        </div>
      </details>
    </section>
  </div>
</Layout>
